This is Project 1 of COSC 320.

-> 2DRegressionGraph.png : Resulting linear regression of the points in the file points100.dat
-> COSC320 Project1 README.pdf : This is the required ReadMe file that contains info on the project.
-> Readme : This file.
-> Regression Complexity.PNG : This is a graph made from the time complexity of the regression from larger amount of data points.
-> Sampleoutput.png : A sample output image from running the program with different points.dat files.
-> Sampleoutput2.png : Another sample output image.
-> main.cpp : The main that runs the different matricies functions (Inverse, Transpose, Multiplication, Subtraction).
-> main2.cpp : The main that tests the linear regression functions.
-> makefile : The makefile that compiles the programs for the project.
-> matrix.cpp : A C++ file that contains the definition of the matrix Class.
-> matrix.h : A C++ header files that contains the declaration of the matrix Class.
-> points100-3d.dat : Contains the data points for the 3-dimensional linear regression.
-> points100.dat : Contains the data points for the 2-dimensional linear regression.

Notes:
  1) This project does not regress data points greater than three dimensions. 
  2) The padding originally made to be in the inverse function does not exist. Instead it is "unpadded" in the main2.cpp file as a "work-around".
  3) Grade: 85.00%
      - Only 2 + 3 dimensional (-5)
      - Does not take filename as input (-5)
      - Need more code comments (-5)
